  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "創新思考與創意實踐",
    "sub_ename": "CREATIVE THINKING AND IDEA IMPLEMENTATION",
    "describe_ch": "創新思考被定義是以不同的觀點及解決方法來面對各種問題，並突破原有的框架。讓我們挑戰以前相關的概念和想法，並提出新的觀點是創新的關鍵所在。本課程會介紹　1.MIT的CDIO創新思考設計方法：從問題發現、創意發想、實踐行動、到自我反思等步驟；2.不同背景群策群力的團隊合作相關議題的探討及操作；3.可行方案的創意發想與設計過程、及創意實踐案例分享。",
    "describe_eh": "A definition of creative thinking is defined as a way to look and solve problems from different perspectives, looking for the solutions and thinking outside the box. This course aims to introduce: 1.CDIO concept: conceive, design, implementation and operation；2.Team work from cross-fields discipline；3. Sharing the creative and successful practice projects.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
